{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "93f4367b-b808-8d89-af70-907aa7841596",
  "created_at": "2025-12-18T10:51:55-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Aisha Singh",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Anita Chaudhry",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T10:47:20-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Anita. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T10:47:26-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, yes. Good morning. I have a, um, a question about a fence. I am calling about a fence."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T10:47:35-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can help with that. What are you thinking of putting up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T10:47:41-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So, I got a quote. From a fence company. And before I sign anything, I want to check with you. Chain-link. Six feet tall. Six."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T10:47:52-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a six-foot chain-link. And is this for your own home, a single-family property?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T10:47:59-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, my home. I am the homeowner. Two sixty-three Gidley Street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T10:48:05-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, Gidley Street in the Fifth Ward. And what's your name, please?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T10:48:11-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Aisha Singh. S-I-N-G-H."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T10:48:13-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Ms. Singh. So what's your question about the fence?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T10:48:19-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Do I need a permit? That is the, the question. A permit. For the fence. The company said they, um, they take care of everything, but I did not understand if that means a permit or not."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T10:48:35-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good thing you're checking. In general, yes, a fence usually does need a permit here, and height matters a lot. Six feet is on the taller side, so it would get looked at. Is it going around the back yard or along the street side?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T10:48:55-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. Both, I think. The back, and one side. The side by the sidewalk. Is that... different?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T10:49:03-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It can be. Fences near the street often have tighter rules than the back. So the permit application would show where it goes on your lot. Did the company give you a drawing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T10:49:18-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A drawing. Um, there is a paper with a, a little sketch. Lines. I have it at home. I am not at home right now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T10:49:29-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. The sketch helps. You'd also want a rough idea of the property lines, since the fence has to sit on your side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T10:49:40-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Property lines. Yes. I think I have a survey. Somewhere. Maybe. [pause] And the fee? How much is the fee for the permit?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T10:49:50-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't have the exact amount in front of me, and it can depend on the project. The inspections office can confirm it when you bring in the application. Do you want me to have someone call you with it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T10:50:08-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, I am traveling. I am in the car, going to the airport. I am very early, actually, too early, so I thought, I will call now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T10:50:21-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, good use of the time. Safe travels. So, when you're back, the application is available at the office, and I can send you what you need to fill out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T10:50:34-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wait. So. Should I sign the contract first? Or the permit first? I do not understand the order."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T10:50:42-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd get the permit sorted before the work starts. Ask the company in writing whether the permit is included in their price and who applies for it. If they apply, it's usually in your name as owner anyway, so you'll want to see it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T10:51:01-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "In my name. Okay. So the company applies, but it is my permit. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T10:51:09-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Roughly, yes. Either they file it for you or you do. Either way you should have a copy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T10:51:17-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hmm. I think I understand. Mostly. Chain-link, six feet, permit, yes. And the fee, I find out at the office."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T10:51:26-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Can I get a number in case we need to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T10:51:33-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-six-one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T10:51:36-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-six-one. Got it. I'll note the fence question on it. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T10:51:43-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. Thank you. I will, um, I will wait to sign. Yes. Wait."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T10:51:49-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sounds wise. Have a good flight, Ms. Singh."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T10:51:53-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
